<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>I had to go about things as usual.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was what <STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE> had told me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rather than told, I had been instructed in a letter.<PG>
By now, is <STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE> meeting <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE>, I wonder.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Can he meet her and negotiate?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will words even get through to <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE>, now that she has become like that?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> seemed to be home, but it looked like she was laid up in bed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It would probably be better not to force her awake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For now, I had to get dinner ready.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> had no appetite because of her April sickness, but that didn't mean I could make nothing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ベランダ開ける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I opened the window of the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, a quiet night wind blew in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was insurance. I was opening the window in case the worst should happen.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\台所1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Bean sprouts... 
{PAUSE ""}
cabbage... 
{PAUSE ""}
carrots... 
{PAUSE ""}
onions...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, if I used the frozen pork, a dish of sorts would come together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tossed the pork into the microwave and chopped the carrots and onions.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I chopped the vegetables with the blade... and the thawed pork―<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A sigh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I went to cut the pork, I put the knife down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I saw that time―<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sighed once more and gripped the knife.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With a grinding scrape, I sank the blade into the half-thawed pork.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I got it over with as quickly as I could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I cut the meat as quickly as I could.<BR>
As quickly as I could―
{PAUSE ""}
quickly―
{PAUSE ""}
quickly―
{PAUSE ""}
quickly.<PG>
But, I stopped my hands, wrapped the pork in plastic wrap, and put it in the refrigerator.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I pulled out a burdock root that had been freezing in a corner of the vegetable drawer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, I wouldn't have to use the pork.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Instead of meat, I took out dried horse mackerel.<PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\炒める.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
I threw the ingredients into the heated frying pan all at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The carrots and the burdock, both at the same time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Usually I put them in properly, in order, but today, all at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Just then, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> came out of her room.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Morning. How are you feeling?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Mmm... better than this afternoon..."</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Think you can eat?"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I'll eat properly today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> isn't back yet?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"He says he's suddenly been sent on a business trip to Hokkaido. He'll be back next week, apparently."</STYLE><PG>
The lie came out so smoothly it surprised even me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was by no means a pleasant feeling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't tell <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> about today's negotiation.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s business trips are always so sudden. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s not here, huh. And I was going to eat takoyaki with him."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Takoyaki?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> gave it to me. As a get-well present."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"We're always, always imposing on </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. We'll have to thank her later."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah... really. I'll thank her properly later."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE> always looks out for <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That makes me happy too, but sometimes I also feel sorry about it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE> is someone she cannot do without.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the reverse is true as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, to me too, both <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE> are precious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nothing can replace them.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
And not only those two. <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE> is the same.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE> had been with me ever since I was old enough to remember.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where did we go wrong?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Such a foolish question came to mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where we went wrong is obvious, no matter who looks at it, or how.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry to keep you waiting. Okay, let's eat."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\たこ焼き桜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh..."</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the surface of the takoyaki sat a single cherry blossom petal.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, I'll take it off right away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hadn't expected a cherry blossom to slip into a place like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, this alone was enough to turn the takoyaki into something revolting.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I-I'm fine! Not eating it over something this small..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> lifted the takoyaki with her chopsticks, but―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\椅子から立つ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
She flung down the takoyaki and chopsticks and ran straight into the bathroom.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\トイレ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"N-</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, are you okay!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hack! Hack!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="3">I... I'm fine... This always happens... Go on and eat..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">All right. Call me if anything happens."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
April sickness...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently it is a little different from trauma.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When Eiichiro-san died, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> was splashed by the spray of blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While a strong wind blew, wrapped in a storm of cherry petals.<PG>
To begin with, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> doesn't even know that Eiichiro-san died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rather than not knowing, she doesn't remember, and it seems she hadn't even understood what happened at the time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So the doctor had said it was strange to call it trauma, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thinking of <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, we should have left Motoki-cho, with its many cherry trees, early on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, because of my selfishness―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>, back from the bathroom, had a somewhat better color in her face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I'm fine now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I see... If you're fine, then good..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What's wrong? Did something happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh? No... nothing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had been clutching my old cell phone the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was still no word from <STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, I couldn't carelessly call him from my end.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Never mind that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you're the one who should at least eat some rice gruel. I'll make it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay, thank you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\台所1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I went to the kitchen and took the earthenware pot down from the shelf.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For now, all I can do is believe in <STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Believe in him, and pray that he is safe.<PG>
It had been written in <STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>'s letter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE> isn't stupid either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she were to lay a hand on our family, even <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE> would not come out of it unharmed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you haven't cleaned the bath yet, have you? I'll go do it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What are you talking about, as wobbly as you are? Sit still and behave."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But I feel like moving around a little would help. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I think April sickness is a matter of mood. I'll go do it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, what I can do is act as usual in front of <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This gloomy air goes against what <STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE> wants.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then I'll take you up on it. But just give the bathtub a light wash, okay? Cleaning for more than 3 minutes is forbidden!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay! I'll go do it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
With a lively step you would never think belonged to someone who had been shut in the bathroom, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> headed for the bath.<PG>
It seemed <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> had closed the living room window.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the end, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> said nothing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, there was no longer any need to make <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s condition any worse.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "裏ルート用\clock-hand1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I had <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> eat the rice gruel and urged her to go to bed early.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> doesn't know anything yet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's better that <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> doesn't know anything yet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is our problem.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A problem that we, as her parents, must solve.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "裏ルート用\clock-hand1速い.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
Before long, the date changed over, and the clock's hands moved unnaturally fast.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still there was no word at all from <STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nor was there any sign that <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE>, next door, had come home.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ガラケ―赤入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>...! Please, hurry and get in touch!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Please, just be safe...!
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
